  "notes": "Expanded to official BPK, Bapanas, BNPB and selected local JDIH. These feeds provide *candidate* discovery, not comprehensive national/provincial historical crawling or legally adjudicated status. Degraded/403 source is displayed; never infer no legal change. On 19 October 2026 four additional public provincial JDIH portals (Aceh, North Sumatra, Bali, East Kalimantan) were added for candidate-only discovery. Newly identified sources require successful baseline scans before change alerts; watch failures are explicit. Added 23 source-linked national instruments to watched document list after legal register expansion. Watch result is candidate-level, not automatic legal status verification. Added targeted regional legal-listing probes and 18 instrument-detail checks (candidate-level only). Regulator or municipality website outages never mean the law has ceased to exist.",
